{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mono Dodge is a fast-paced skill-based game designed for quick bursts of intense action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your friends in fast 1v1 duels \u2014 or enter Solo Dodge Mode and survive an endless barrage of skill shots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge or be deleted \u2013 Outplay your opponent or dodge for your life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 Online \u2013 Face your friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Mode: Dodge Master \u2013 Survive as long as you can against relentless projectiles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls \u2013 Easy to pick up, hard to put down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're waiting in queue, dodging a match, or just want to sharpen your reflexes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mono Dodge is the perfect mini-challenge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790200?t=1751067549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790200?t=1751067549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790200/94fbae8b580fd819cacc773d7e323581e0ddbbff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751067549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790200/94fbae8b580fd819cacc773d7e323581e0ddbbff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751067549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mono Dodge is a fast-paced skill-based game designed for quick bursts of intense action.</p><p class=\"b